{"id":"e4b2b1248dfeccfd","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete.md","title":"0/1整数规划的NP完全性","display":"thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete — 0/1整数规划的NP完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete","aliases":["28-thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete"],"display":"thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete — 0/1整数规划的NP完全性","depends_on":["[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]","[[28-df-binary-integer-programming]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 2.16 and proof","source_printed_pages":"52–53","source_pdf_pages":"78–79","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete — 0/1整数规划的NP完全性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8db0d5d40e579d59\" href=\"?note=8db0d5d40e579d59\" title=\"28-thm-3sat-np-complete\">28-thm-3sat-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ad514459f1a0090\" href=\"?note=6ad514459f1a0090\" title=\"28-df-binary-integer-programming\">28-df-binary-integer-programming</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 2.16 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"52–53"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"78–79"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>3SAT的NP完全性采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8db0d5d40e579d59\" href=\"?note=8db0d5d40e579d59\" title=\"28-thm-3sat-np-complete\">28-thm-3sat-np-complete</a> 的陈述与既有证据边界。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BIP}\">\\(\\mathrm{BIP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6ad514459f1a0090\" href=\"?note=6ad514459f1a0090\" title=\"28-df-binary-integer-programming\">28-df-binary-integer-programming</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BIP}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BIP}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给定0/1赋值，可用多项式位复杂度有理数算术检验所有不等式，故在NP。把3SAT子句中的正文字x_i替成u_i，负文字替成1-u_i；要求三个数之和≥1。所得一组线性不等式与全部子句可满足当且仅当成立，构造长度为多项式，给出NP难性。该证明使用3SAT的已知完全性；此次未重新复核Cook–Levin构造，故不作为本次已核验证明依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 2.16 and proof；印刷 pp.52–53 / PDF pp.78–79。本次核对范围：对应陈述；证明边界见本节，未升级为完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-thm-3sat-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"8db0d5d40e579d59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-integer-programming","status":"resolved","id":"6ad514459f1a0090","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-integer-programming]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-3sat-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"8db0d5d40e579d59","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"3SAT的NP完全性采用 [[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]] 的陈述与既有证据边界。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-integer-programming","status":"resolved","id":"6ad514459f1a0090","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BIP}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-integer-programming]]；$\\mathrm{NPComplete}$ 见 [[28-df-np-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BIP}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-integer-programming]]；$\\mathrm{NPComplete}$ 见 [[28-df-np-complete]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BIP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BIP}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}.","display":true}],"bytes":1738,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-279","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tmsat]]、[[28-thm-tmsat-np-complete]]、[[28-df-binary-integer-programming]]、[[28-thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-np-certificate-search]]。"}],"outgoing":["8db0d5d40e579d59","6ad514459f1a0090","7a91